<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0585_T25R0301_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m a homie whisperer. Certified.\nBy me.\rTreat your homies right, they ride\nfor you. Lemme read yours...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0585_T25R0301_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It look SO happy!\nIt would take a bullet for you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0585_T25R0301_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It deadass trust you.\nLike I trust my barber.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0585_T25R0301_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s cool with you. It look kinda\nhappy. Like a Tuesday.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0585_T25R0301_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s real cute. That’s all I got.\nI’m still learnin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0585_T25R0301_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You should treat it better. It\nlook at you like I look at my\flandlord.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0585_T25R0301_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It don’t like you AT ALL. It’s\nplottin’. I can see it in the eyes.\fSleep with one eye open, fr.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0585_T25R0301_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I keep losin’ scraps and my homies\nkeep faintin’...\rMaybe that’s why my homies don’t\nlike me. Or maybe it’s the cologne.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0585_T25R0301_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When I use stuff on my homies,\nthey act SO glad!\rI gave mine a Hennessy. Now it\nwon’t stop callin’ its ex.</language>
	</row>
</body>
